# SSO=authelia of tests/e2e-fxa.sh, the accounts pages: an Authelia sign-in first, but on the
# paths that Firefox and the servers fetch on their own (docs/single-sign-on.md#what-firefox-sends)
@sso not path /.well-known/fxa-client-configuration /.well-known/openid-configuration /__heartbeat__ /__lbheartbeat__
forward_auth @sso authelia:9091 {
	uri /api/authz/forward-auth
}
